# Hugging Face is another goldmine

The Hugging Face Hub has open APIs for models, datasets and Spaces, with machine-readable OpenAPI definitions and webhooks. ([Hugging Face][4])

The Hub exposes metadata useful for adoption intelligence including downloads, likes, tags and repository information; their current CLI/API tooling explicitly supports fetching these expanded properties programmatically. ([Hugging Face][5])

So monitor:

```text
model downloads
download acceleration
likes
new model releases
new organizations
model forks/derivatives
dataset downloads
Space popularity
task/category growth
```

You can derive:

```text
Qwen family adoption ↑
small-model downloads ↑
vision-language releases ↑
agent-trace datasets ↑
```

This becomes your **open-model economy telemetry**.

