# The signal hierarchy I would use

Not all signals deserve equal weight.

### Tier A — behavioral

Strongest.

```text
OpenRouter model tokens
OpenRouter app tokens
package download activity
dependency adoption
MCP use counts
```

### Tier B — implementation

Very useful.

```text
GitHub dependencies
new repos
commits
contributors
package releases
Docker usage
```

### Tier C — attention

Useful leading indicators.

```text
Google Trends
Cloudflare domain trends
HN discussion
Wikipedia pageviews
news volume
```

### Tier D — stated intention

Useful but weaker.

```text
surveys
developer polls
wishlists
```

### Tier E — marketing claims

Weakest.

```text
company says "millions of users"
press release
vendor benchmark
```

Do not combine them blindly.

