# Don't produce fake user counts

This is particularly important for your example:

> users of each provider

For most providers, you won't know this.

So do not invent:

```text
Anthropic users = 12.4m
```

Instead expose:

```text
provider:
  anthropic

observed_signals:
  openrouter_tokens_share
  models_used_share
  sdk_downloads
  github_dependency_share
  cloudflare_domain_rank
  google_search_share
  survey_usage
```

Then derive:

```text
adoption_index
```

and label it explicitly as an index.

